{"id":"6a7373c2c1770e9a1a84cf5731e7186ad600781d","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"6a7373c2c1770e9a1a84cf5731e7186ad600781d","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/pnpx-version.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpx --version` and `pnpm dlx --version` now print the pnpm version. Other unknown options before the command are reported as errors. Before, pnpm tried to download a package named after the option [#16259](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/16259)."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/cli_command/commands.rs","lines":["@@ -146,6 +146,7 @@ pub enum CliCommand {","     /// Run a shell command in the context of a project.","     Exec(ExecArgs),","     /// Run a package in a temporary environment.","+    #[clap(version = pnpm_config::PNPM_VERSION, disable_version_flag = true)]","     Dlx(DlxArgs),","     /// Creates a project from a `create-*` starter kit.","     Create(CreateArgs),"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/create.rs","lines":["@@ -102,6 +102,7 @@ impl CreateArgs {","         let create_name = convert_to_create_name(&name);","         let dlx_args = DlxArgs {","             command: std::iter::once(create_name).chain(args).collect(),","+            version: None,","             package: vec![],","             allow_build,","             shell_mode,"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/dlx.rs","lines":["@@ -54,9 +54,13 @@ use std::{"," #[derive(Debug, Args)]"," pub struct DlxArgs {","     /// The command to run, followed by its arguments.","-    #[clap(trailing_var_arg = true, allow_hyphen_values = true)]","+    #[clap(trailing_var_arg = true)]","     pub command: Vec<String>,"," ","+    /// Print the pnpm version.","+    #[clap(short = 'v', long = \"version\", action = clap::ArgAction::Version)]","+    pub version: Option<bool>,","+","     /// The package to install before running the command. May be","     /// repeated. When omitted, the command name is the package.","     #[clap(long = \"package\")]"],"additions":5,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/dlx/tests.rs","lines":["@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ use tempfile::tempdir;"," /// Parses `DlxArgs` as a flattened leaf so the architecture flags can be"," /// exercised against the trailing `command` positional."," #[derive(Parser)]","+#[command(version = \"0.0.0\", disable_version_flag = true)]"," struct DlxArgsWrapper {","     #[command(flatten)]","     dlx: DlxArgs,","@@ -54,6 +55,32 @@ fn architecture_flags_accumulate_and_default_empty() {","     assert_eq!(parsed.dlx.command, [\"tool\"]);"," }"," ","+#[test]","+fn flags_after_the_command_belong_to_the_command() {","+    let parsed = DlxArgsWrapper::try_parse_from([\"dlx\", \"node\", \"-e\", \"1\", \"--version\"])","+        .expect(\"parse dlx args\");","+","+    assert_eq!(parsed.dlx.command, [\"node\", \"-e\", \"1\", \"--version\"]);","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn a_version_flag_before_the_command_prints_the_version() {","+    for flag in [\"--version\", \"-v\"] {","+        let error = DlxArgsWrapper::try_parse_from([\"dlx\", flag])","+            .err()","+            .unwrap_or_else(|| panic!(\"`dlx {flag}` must not parse {flag} as the command\"));","+        assert_eq!(error.kind(), clap::error::ErrorKind::DisplayVersion, \"{flag}\");","+    }","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn an_unknown_flag_before_the_command_is_rejected() {","+    let error = DlxArgsWrapper::try_parse_from([\"dlx\", \"--bogus\"])","+        .err()","+        .expect(\"`dlx --bogus` must not parse --bogus as the command\");","+    assert_eq!(error.kind(), clap::error::ErrorKind::UnknownArgument);","+}","+"," fn regs(default: &str) -> BTreeMap<String, String> {","     let mut map = BTreeMap::new();","     map.insert(\"default\".to_string(), default.to_string());"],"additions":27,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/pnpx_alias.rs","lines":["@@ -37,6 +37,29 @@ fn launched_as_pnpx_injects_the_dlx_subcommand() {","     assert_eq!(pnpx_help, dlx_help, \"`pnpx --help` should equal `dlx --help` (dlx was injected)\");"," }"," ","+#[test]","+fn pnpx_version_prints_the_pnpm_version() {","+    let pacquet = env!(\"CARGO_BIN_EXE_pnpm\");","+","+    let dir = TempDir::new().expect(\"create temp dir\");","+    let pnpx = copy_executable(Path::new(pacquet), dir.path(), \"pnpx\");","+","+    for flag in [\"--version\", \"-v\"] {","+        let output = Command::new(&pnpx)","+            .current_dir(dir.path())","+            .arg(flag)","+            .output()","+            .expect(\"run `pnpx --version`\");","+        assert!(","+            output.status.success(),","+            \"`pnpx {flag}` exited with a failure status: {}\",","+            String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stderr),","+        );","+        let stdout = String::from_utf8(output.stdout).expect(\"version is UTF-8\");","+        assert_eq!(stdout.trim(), pnpm_config::PNPM_VERSION, \"`pnpx {flag}`\");","+    }","+}","+"," #[test]"," fn launched_as_pnpx_hands_scripts_the_pnpm_beside_it() {","     let CommandTempCwd { pacquet, root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();",""],"additions":23,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":62,"deletions":1,"truncated":false,"file_count":6},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-27T13:15:58.171273+00:00"}